{"leads":{"agent":"Paul David","task":"leads","notes":[{"id":"nmuy736zjar8","text":"California Insurance Guarantee Association - CIGA is not a health plan, IPA, or behavioral health network. Its role is to handle claims when a California property/casualty insurer becomes insolvent. It primarily administers workers' compensation, liability, and auto claims.","at":"2026-10-07T14:20:36.511Z","by":"Paul David"},{"id":"nmuy73i5qnmj","text":"Central California Physician Partners (CCPP) - sent an email with letter of interest .","at":"2026-10-07T14:20:50.990Z","by":"Paul David"},{"id":"nmuy73z79nl8","text":"Chaparral Medical Group -  A physician group practice with over 75-80 doctors across more than 20 medical specialties operating across Southern California's Inland Empire (such as Pomona, Chino, and Rancho Cucamonga).","at":"2026-10-07T14:21:13.077Z","by":"Paul David"},{"id":"nmuy74afjdr0","text":"Hoag Physician Partners (HPP)- sent them an email with letter of interest .","at":"2026-10-07T14:21:27.631Z","by":"Paul David"},{"id":"nmuy75jdor0q","text":"Inyo County HHS -   governmental county","at":"2026-10-07T14:22:25.884Z","by":"Paul David"},{"id":"nmuy765z9t3j","text":"Kern Psychiatric Health and Wellness Center - IPA, Inc.- Kern Psychiatric Health and Wellness Center - IPA, Inc. is an IPA (Independent Practice Association) / Medical Group, not a payer","at":"2026-10-07T14:22:55.173Z","by":"Paul David"},{"id":"nmuy76mu3rr2","text":"-Loma Linda Psychiatric Medical Group (LLPMG) - Loma Linda Psychiatric Medical Group (LLPMG) is a behavioral health practice / provider group (an outpatient clinical group providing psychiatric evaluation, psychotherapy, medication management, and TMS therapy), rather than an IPA (Independent Practice Association) or a health insurance payer","at":"2026-10-07T14:23:17.019Z","by":"Paul David"},{"id":"nmuy76xm6giz","text":"Landscape, Irrigation & Lawn Sprinkler Trust Funds - I found that the fund provides medical coverage, but the public sources do not specifically state whether behavioral health services are carved out, managed internally, or administered through another network.","at":"2026-10-07T14:23:30.990Z","by":"Paul David"},{"id":"nmuy778iwr4d","text":"MarinHealth Medical Network - sent them an email requesting to join their network","at":"2026-10-07T14:23:45.128Z","by":"Paul David"},{"id":"nmuy77klvsx7","text":"Midwest General Insurance Agency, LLC - The publicly available information identifies Midwest General Insurance Agency, LLC as an insurance agency/broker, not a health plan, IPA, medical group, behavioral health network, or TPA managing provider networks.","at":"2026-10-07T14:24:00.787Z","by":"Paul David"},{"id":"nmuy77vhu7kh","text":"Personify Health - Personify Health is neither an IPA (Independent Practice Association) nor a traditional risk-bearing insurance payer; instead, it is a Third-Party Administrator (TPA) and digital health platform , but i filled a form by our email in their website .","at":"2026-10-07T14:24:14.898Z","by":"Paul David"},{"id":"nmuy786k227j","text":"Premier Workers' Compensation, LLC - Premier Workers' Compensation, LLC operates as a payer network entity (specifically a Medical Provider Network / PPO network) within the workers' compensation system, rather than an Independent Physician Association (IPA), sent them an email .","at":"2026-10-07T14:24:29.234Z","by":"Paul David"},{"id":"nmuy78jjcjtb","text":"Nonstop Health - Nonstop Health is health insurance-related, but it is not a traditional insurance carrier like Aetna, Cigna, Anthem, or UnitedHealthcare. It provides employer-sponsored health benefit solutions that work alongside underlying health plan, Behavioral health network: I found no evidence that it directly manages a psychiatry network , but i filled a form by our email in their website .","at":"2026-10-07T14:24:46.056Z","by":"Paul David"},{"id":"nmuy78swbt8i","text":"Verda Healthcare - send them an email requesting to join network .","at":"2026-10-07T14:24:58.187Z","by":"Paul David"},{"id":"nmuy791agojn","text":"UCSD PHSO - filled a form on their website , and sent a email requesting to join the network .","at":"2026-10-07T14:25:09.064Z","by":"Paul David"},{"id":"nmuy79c3besu","text":"Three Rivers Provider Network (TRPN) - I did not find a source specifically confirming a dedicated behavioral health or psychiatry network.","at":"2026-10-07T14:25:23.063Z","by":"Paul David"},{"id":"nmuy79sutlwu","text":"Teamsters Benefit Trust (TBT) - workscom","at":"2026-10-07T14:25:44.789Z","by":"Paul David"},{"id":"nmuy7a4vnfu3","text":"Modern Health - sent them an email with letter interest to join the network .","at":"2026-10-07T14:26:00.371Z","by":"Paul David"},{"id":"nmuy7ag28e5v","text":"C3 MSSP LLC - it is a Medicare-focused corporate affiliate of Community Care Cooperative (C3), which is a non-profit ACO formed and governed by Federally Qualified Health Centers","at":"2026-10-07T14:26:14.864Z","by":"Paul David"},{"id":"nmuy7auw8k26","text":"Caravan Collaborative Pathways","at":"2026-10-07T14:26:34.088Z","by":"Paul David"},{"id":"nmuy7b8o8lw7","text":"Benefit Service Center Administrators Inc - it appears to be a benefits administrator rather than a behavioral health network.","at":"2026-10-07T14:26:51.944Z","by":"Paul David"}],"count":null,"at":"2026-10-07T14:26:51.944Z"},"em-contracted":{"agent":"Paul David","task":"em-contracted","notes":[{"id":"nmuy7by01mpe","text":"sent an email to Hoag Physician Partners (HPP) after they reply me by the correct email for contracting","at":"2026-10-07T14:27:24.769Z","by":"Paul David"}],"count":null,"at":"2026-10-07T14:27:24.769Z"},"directory":{"agent":"Paul David","task":"directory","notes":[{"id":"nmuy7chohwb2","text":"sent an email with the most updated roster to CAPR@ahf.org requesting to update the provider portal .","at":"2026-10-07T14:27:50.273Z","by":"Paul David"}],"count":null,"at":"2026-10-07T14:27:50.273Z"}}